* F-A1 (-m sampled-time / last VCD timestep): netlist without an analysis directive -> default TRAN.
* specs -m sampled-time -f a1-tran-no-analysis.cir -o traces/st : VCD has no value change at all.
* specs -f a1-tran-no-analysis.cir -o traces/td : "Simulated 3300 fs" but the VCD ends at #23;
*   the out-net change at 3.3 ps (0.5 W) is never written.
vlsrc1 in values=[[1e-12,1,1.55e-6],[2e-12,0.5,1.55e-6]]
wg1 in out length=100e-6 neff=2.3 ng=4 att=0
